      "title": "ldap: make use of STRING_CASE_INSENSITIVE for CLDAP",
      "message": "ldap: make use of STRING_CASE_INSENSITIVE for CLDAP\n\nCommit 05e404e8cbb8c3e45324fc924f0e9a30c72c9d32 was wrong...\n\nThis allows dissection of the 'NETLOGON' attribute in\nthe same way as the 'netlogon' attribute.\n\nSigned-off-by: Stefan Metzmacher <metze@samba.org>\n",
      "author_name": "Stefan Metzmacher",
