      "title": "ldap: assume GSS-SPNEGO as default",
      "message": "ldap: assume GSS-SPNEGO as default\n\nThis allows GSSAPI/SASL dissection if the ldap bind is not captured.\n\nSigned-off-by: Stefan Metzmacher <metze@samba.org>\n",
